/* Windows resource script — embeds descry.ico into the exe so Explorer,
 * the taskbar, and the Alt+Tab switcher pick it up automatically.
 * Compiled by windres via CMake's RC language (see CMakeLists.txt). */

IDI_ICON1 ICON "descry.ico"

/* Application manifest (activeCodePage=UTF-8, supported OS list) — see
 * descry.manifest. 24 == RT_MANIFEST, 1 == CREATEPROCESS_MANIFEST_RESOURCE_ID.
 * ld skips MinGW's default-manifest.o when the objects already carry one. */
1 24 "descry.manifest"
